{"id":"629334","name":"小笼包","author":"金凤栖梧","authorId":"8221247","desc":"","cover":"images/629334/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"600g"},{"name":"温水","amount":"340g"},{"name":"干酵母粉","amount":"7g"}],"sub":[{"name":"猪肉","amount":"一块"},{"name":"葱","amount":"1颗"},{"name":"姜","amount":"3片"},{"name":"水","amount":"半小碗"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"葱姜切段切片。","img":"images/629334/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"姜葱放榨汁机中加水搅成汁。","img":"images/629334/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"猪肉绞碎。","img":"images/629334/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入所有调料，搅拌匀。","img":"images/629334/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把葱姜水分次少量加入肉馅中，然用搅拌，让姜葱水入肉中充分吸中，然后放冰箱冷藏10分钟拿出，再加姜葱水再拌，放冰箱，最后肉馅是粘稠的。","img":"images/629334/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"和好的馅。","img":"images/629334/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"面粉加温水、酵母和成面团，盆下放温水发酵。","img":"images/629334/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"揉匀排气包包子。","img":"images/629334/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"包好了。","img":"images/629334/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入抹了油的蒸屉上再发酵15分钟。","img":"images/629334/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"水开蒸13分钟，关火焖3分钟开盖。","img":"images/629334/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/629334/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"好吃。","img":"images/629334/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/629334/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}